1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
The Wool Sweater

2
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,220
Winter comes.

3
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:21,800
In class, Lan sees Hoa has a beautiful yellow wool sweater.

4
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:32,930
Going home, she tells mother she wants a sweater like that.

5
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:36,930
Mother says:

6
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:48,240
If I buy that sweater for you then no money to buy sweater for Tuan.

7
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:53,930
Lan is angry at mother pretends to sleep.

8
00:00:53,930 --> 00:01:01,150
Later, Lan hears Tuan whispering to mother:

9
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:07,460
Mother just needs to buy sweater for me only.

10
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:17,240
Hearing that, Lan feels very regretful.

